ail Bethan the party address\", \"scrap that, I'll check later\"], [\"umm can you email Bethan the, uh, the address of the party?\", \"oh actually never mind, I'll just check it myself later\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0028\", \"v\": [[\"photos from last week\", \"third one into Gamelan club highlights album\", \"wrong one, meant the wharf one\"], [\"umm can you show me the photos I took last week?\", \"ok so can you put the third one in the, uh, Gamelan club highlights album\", \"oh no wait, that's the wrong photo, I meant the wharf one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0029\", \"v\": [[\"umm so for Bozena in number 19 house, can you, uh, settle up with her?\", \"oh and also can you find the trovora bank thing?\", \"ok can I see the password?\"], [\"bozena in number 19 house, pls settle up w her\", \"also find the trovora bank one\", \"whats the password\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0030\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you add twenty dollars for Bozena's taxi to number 19 house? I paid for it\"], [\"add twenty dollars for Bozena's taxi to number 19 house pls, i paid\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0031\", \"v\": [[\"weathervane pic into Tatting session highlights album\", \"what else is in it?\", \"delete the first one\", \"what's left in there?\", \"bin the Leandro one\", \"oops, undo that\"], [\"Could you please put the weathervane photo in the Tatting session highlights album?\", \"Thank you. Could you show me what else is in that album?\", \"Would you mind deleting the first one, please?\", \"Could you tell me what else is still in that album?\", \"Please delete the Leandro one as well.\", \"Oh, I'm sorry, I didn't mean to do that. Could you undo it, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0032\", \"v\": [[\"pls delete every gamelan appointment i have\", \"oops undo that\", \"diff thing, add twenty dollars for tickets to the Salento group, i paid\"], [\"delete every gamelan appointment\", \"oops, undo\", \"add twenty dollars for tickets to Salento, I paid\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0033\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to keep better track of who I've seen lately, so could you log that I visited Mandara today?\", \"Oh sorry, there are two of them, aren't there. It was Mandara Calloway I meant.\"], [\"Could you please log that I visited Mandara today?\", \"It was Mandara Calloway, please.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0034\", \"v\": [[\"I've been meaning to keep a record of who I see so I don't lose touch with people, so could you log that I visited Mandara Calloway today?\"], [\"Would you please log that I visited Mandara Calloway today?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0035\", \"v\": [[\"I keep forgetting what I was going to look into when I'm at the shops, so could you note down prices for the plum for me before it slips my mind?\"], [\"Could you please make a note: prices for the plum?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0037\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me who's invited to the call carmen, please?\", \"Which events is Roisin coming to, please?\", \"Could you show me just the ones on sunday, please?\"], [\"who's invited to call carmen?\", \"Roisin's events?\", \"just sunday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0039\", \"v\": [[\"make a note: gift ideas for Mandara\", \"also what pics do i have from this month\", \"show me just the second one\", \"which album is it in\", \"whats else in that album\"], [\"Could you please make a note called gift ideas for Mandara?\", \"On another subject, could you show me the pictures I have from this month?\", \"Would you mind showing me just the second one?\", \"Could you tell me which album it's in, please?\", \"And could you show me what else is in that album, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0040\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you add the Leandro picture to the, uh, Gamelan club highlights album?\", \"ok and which album's it in now?\", \"oh wait, no, wrong photo, I meant the weathervane one\"], [\"Could you please add the Leandro picture to the Gamelan club highlights album?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me which album it's in?\", \"I'm sorry, that was the wrong photo. I meant the weathervane one, please.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0041\", \"v\": [[\"uh can you find the marimba shopping thing?\", \"ok and um, what other notes are in that same notebook?\"], [\"Could you please find the marimba shopping note for me?\", \"Would you mind showing me the other notes in the same notebook?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0043\", \"v\": [[\"um what events is Aziz coming to?\", \"oh and, uh, can you get rid of every sharpen to-do?\"], [\"I'm trying to work out how often I'll be seeing Aziz, so could you tell me what events Aziz is coming to?\", \"Different thing, my list is cluttered with stuff I'll never get round to, so could you get rid of every sharpen to-do?\"]]}","ttft_ms":18756,"type":"result","duration_ms":31727,"uuid":"84007ff3-5e77-4ad1-879a-474292a88142","ttft_stream_ms":1277,"time_to_request_ms":181,"first_content_frame_ms":1277,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22450456,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790279001039.5515,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
